DOCUMENT();
loadMacros(
"PGstandard.pl",
"MathObjects.pl",
"PGML.pl"
);
Context("Interval");

$set_ans_6 = Compute("([2, 5]) U ({10, 12, 19}) U {17, 19}");
$set_ans_7 = Compute("{17, 19} U ({17, 19} U ({17, 19} U ({17, 19}))) - ((-infinity, infinity) - ({10, 12, 19} U {10, 12, 19})) U ([2, 5])");
$set_ans_8 = Compute("({10, 12, 19} U {10, 12, 19}) - ((-infinity, infinity) - [2, 5]) - ((-infinity, infinity) - {17, 19})");
$set_ans_4 = Compute("(-infinity, 16] U {2, 8, 17, 18} U (-infinity, 16]");
$set_ans_5 = Compute("(-infinity, 16] U {2, 8, 17, 18}");
$set_ans_1 = Compute("[0, 10] U [0, 10]");
$set_ans_2 = Compute("(0, 6) U {1, 3, 10, 18}");
$set_ans_3 = Compute("(0, 6) - ((-infinity, infinity) - (0, 6)) - ((-infinity, infinity) - (0, 6))");

Context("Vector");

BEGIN_PGML
# Questions:

_For arithmetic problems, if the result is not an integer, then retain *three significant digits*._

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{1, 3, 10, 18\}`]
- [`B = \{x | 0 < x < 6\}`]
- [`C = \{x | 0 \leq x \leq 10\}`]

Compute:
- [`C \cup C = `] [_____]{$set_ans_1}
- [`B \cup A = `] [_____]{$set_ans_2}
- [`B \cap B \cap B = `] [_____]{$set_ans_3}

---

What is the value of [`19+15-12+10/19`]? [_____]{22.5263157895}
---

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{2, 8, 17, 18\}`]
- [`B = \{x | x \leq 16\}`]

Compute:
- [`B \cup A \cup B = `] [_____]{$set_ans_4}
- [`B \cup A = `] [_____]{$set_ans_5}

---

What is the value of [`6*1+9*1`]? [_____]{Real(15.)}
---

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{10, 12, 19\}`]
- [`B = \{x | 2 \leq x \leq 5\}`]
- [`C = \{17, 19\}`]

Compute:
- [`(B) \cup (A) \cup C = `] [_____]{$set_ans_6}
- [`C \cup (C \cup (C \cup (C))) \cap (A \cup A) \cup (B) = `] [_____]{$set_ans_7}
- [`(A \cup A) \cap B \cap C = `] [_____]{$set_ans_8}

---
END_PGML
ENDDOCUMENT();
